  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Anti-Retroviral treatment costing study in Sierra Leone</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">CAFOD, UNAIDS and National AIDS Secretariat (NAS) are collaborating to conduct an extensive study on understanding the cost drivers for HIV/AIDS treatment in Sierra Leone. Prior to now, no such study has been conducted in HIV/AIDS landscape in Sierra Leone. The result of the study would further help the government, funders and other implementing partners in planning effectively for future expenditure requirements and also identifying strategies for improving the efficiency of HIV treatment programs.</narrative>
  </description>
